OL,3,GNEWSAImprovements to bus services
OL,4,Aexpected 'next week'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's bus services are being run
OL,7,Fby the "right operator", the president
OL,8,Fof the Envrionment and Infrastructure
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FStagecoach has come under fire in
OL,12,Frecent months after driver shortages
OL,13,Fled to delayed and cancelled services.
OL,15,FIn an update to the States, Adrian
OL,16,FGabriel said services have "not been
OL,17,Fgood enough" and he was meeting with
OL,18,FStagecoach's managing director.
OL,20,FHe said that the meeting went "very
OL,21,Fwell" and he expects to "see
OL,22,Fimprovements from next week".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
